<div data-acc-panel style="display:block;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">With DIY, you rent the gear and run the games yourself. With full service, we bring everything, set up the battlefield, referee 90 minutes of games and clean up afterward.</div>
